<% layout('layouts/boilerplate') -%>

<div class="container py-4">
    <div class="row g-5">
        <!-- Left Column: Club Info -->
        <div class="col-lg-8">
            <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold text-white mb-4">About <span class="text-danger">Code Sastra</span></h1>
            <p class="text-secondary lead fs-4">
                Code Sastra is the official Coding Club of the Information Technology Department at Rajkiya Engineering College, Azamgarh.
            </p>
            
            <hr class="border-secondary border-opacity-25 my-5">

            <h3 class="text-white fw-bold mb-3">Our Vision</h3>
            <p class="text-secondary fs-5">
                To cultivate a robust programming culture where students transition seamlessly from theoretical academic learning to building, testing, and deploying real-world digital solutions.
            </p>
            
            <h3 class="text-white fw-bold mt-5 mb-3">Goals & Objectives</h3>
            <ul class="list-group list-group-flush bg-transparent">
                <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent text-secondary border-secondary border-opacity-25 py-3 d-flex align-items-center">
                    <span class="text-danger me-3 fs-4">&bull;</span> Foster peer-to-peer learning in Web Development, App Development, and Competitive Programming.
                </li>
                <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent text-secondary border-secondary border-opacity-25 py-3 d-flex align-items-center">
                    <span class="text-danger me-3 fs-4">&bull;</span> Organize technical events including hackathons, bug bounties, debugging challenges, and tech seminars.
                </li>
                <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent text-secondary border-secondary border-opacity-25 py-3 d-flex align-items-center">
                    <span class="text-danger me-3 fs-4">&bull;</span> Bridge the gap between standard academic curriculum and modern industry requirements.
                </li>
                <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent text-secondary border-secondary border-opacity-25 py-3 d-flex align-items-center">
                    <span class="text-danger me-3 fs-4">&bull;</span> Build a strong alumni network and promote active open-source contributions.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Right Column: IT Dept Info -->
        <div class="col-lg-4">
            <div class="card bg-black border-secondary border-opacity-25 shadow-sm p-4 sticky-top" style="top: 100px;">
                <h4 class="text-white border-bottom border-secondary border-opacity-25 pb-3 mb-3">IT Department</h4>
                <p class="text-secondary mt-2">
                    The Department of Information Technology at Rajkiya Engineering College, Azamgarh is committed to producing top-tier engineers equipped with cutting-edge technological skills, ethical values, and an innovative mindset.
                </p>
                <p class="text-secondary">
                    Our curriculum and club activities are designed hand-in-hand to ensure holistic technical development for all students.
                </p>
                <a href="http://gecazamgarh.ac.in/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline-danger w-100 mt-4 py-2">
                    Visit College Website
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>